1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,875
Name it in four words.

2
00:00:01,875 --> 00:00:06,002
Conjoint: xylem and phloem in one bundle.

3
00:00:06,002 --> 00:00:09,635
Collateral: on the same radius, phloem outside.

4
00:00:09,635 --> 00:00:12,226
Open: there is cambium between them.

5
00:00:12,226 --> 00:00:13,606
And endarch.

